.PP
\fBSyncedText\fR: a scrolling list of timed lines with the current one highlighted (lyrics, subtitles, a transcript). Pressing a line asks to seek to its time.
.PP
The application owns the playback position. The component is controlled: give it the lines and the position, and call \fBfollow_synced_text\fR whenever the current line changes so the list scrolls with it.
.PP
.nf
.RS
SyncedText::new(LYRICS, &self.lines, Msg::Seek).position(self.pos)

// in update, when the position moves to another line:
follow_synced_text(LYRICS, synced::current(&self.lines, self.pos), self.lines.len())
.RE
.fi
